flowchart TD
  U[Browser] --> CDN[CDN<br/>popular redirects]
  CDN -- miss --> LB[Load balancer]
  LB --> R[Redirect service]
  LB --> W[Link service<br/>create · alias · delete]
  R --> C[(Redis<br/>code → url)]
  R -. miss .-> DB[(Links store<br/>partitioned by code)]
  W --> DB
  W --> IDS[ID ranges<br/>allocator]
  R -- click event --> K{{Kafka}}
  K --> A[Analytics aggregator] --> AS[(Analytics store)]
